KDiskMark: KDiskMark is an HDD and SSD benchmark tool with a very friendly
KDiskMark: graphical user interface. KDiskMark with its presets and powerful GUI
KDiskMark: calls Flexible I/O Tester and handles the output to provide an easy
KDiskMark: to view and interpret comprehensive benchmark result. The application
KDiskMark: is written in C++ with Qt and doesn't have any KDE dependencies.
